    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "David Ross Estate Agents your local property experts are delighted to present 62 Captains Avenue, Crumlin.\r\nCaptains Avenue is one of Crumlin’s most established and sought-after residential addresses, renowned for its attractive tree-lined setting and enduring appeal. Ideally situated within easy reach of local shops, schools, parks and excellent transport links, the area offers exceptional convenience for modern family living. Dublin City Centre is just a short commute away, while a host of recreational and sporting amenities are close at hand. \r\nThis lovely terrace home is perfect for all types of buyers looking to create their dream home as it offers the opportunity to purchase in a location that continues to attract strong interest from discerning buyers. \r\nOn the ground floor you are welcomed into a large open living space with a feature fireplace. To the rear of the property is a generous dining area and kitchen with direct access to a large sunny garden.\r\nOn the first floor you will find two generously sized bedrooms with the largest spanning the full width of the property at the front.  The first floor also houses a family  bathroom\r\nCombining bright and well proportioned accommodation with a superb location 62 Captains Avenue provides a rare opportunity for families and first time buyer alike to purchase in this much sought after location.  Early viewing is highly recommended to experience everything this charming property has to offer.\r\nViewing by appointment only.\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\nTerrace Property\r\nExcellently located\r\n2 years vacant\r\nLarge & Sunny garden"
      },
